{50}{I am...we here at Tulla are not much for open conflict. This could be a difficult situation to negotiate. I was wondering if you would care to help us out in this matter?}{I am...we here at Tulla are not much for open conflict. This could be a difficult situation to negotiate. I was wondering if you would care to help us out in this matter?}{}{}{}{ }
